  "label": "A recurring humorous or ironic pattern in internet memes",
  "description": "The meme format of a person proudly presenting a product or accomplishment with a celebratory phrase like 'voila!' is a common internet trope. This trope is often used to exaggerate or humorously highlight a mundane or routine task (like baking) as if it were a grand achievement. Understanding this trope helps interpret the meme’s intent as lighthearted and self-congratulatory.",
